Firefox is a huge pain to cross-compile. It's also a bit of a resource hog.
You can build Midori+WebKit much easier, and it is already in buildroot.
(Probably has less memory leaks too)

 If you must have Firefox, there is a cross compiling how-to here:

http://www.mozilla.org/build/cross-compiling.html

